            <div xml:id="d353">

                <pb facs="0452" n="440" sameAs="frus:frus1937v01/pg440"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.52/201a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Counselor of Embassy in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Thurston</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-10-29T22:00:00-05:00">October 29, 1937—10
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>406. Please keep us currently informed regarding plans or decisions of other
                    missions in respect to the question of removal to Barcelona. We shall also need
                    reports from time to time on the progress of the removal of the Government; in
                    particular we desire to know when it is proposed to transfer the Ministry of
                    State.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Welles</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
